      "content": "hey, im working on a report for a client who wants to know which of these current trends/styles are \"high-end\" vs more \"street\" or \"mass market.\" can u help me categorize these based on their level of social sophistication and who they'd appeal to?\n\n1. drill music / trap beats\n2. cottagecore aesthetic\n3. mumble rap / melodic rap\n4. minimalist lo-fi indie\n5. reggaeton/dancehall style\n6. \"old money\" / preppy aesthetic\n\nbasically need to know which ones feel more \"elevated\" and which ones feel more \"urban/grassroots\" for brand positioning. thanks",
